Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra! Extra! Extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It says that Momose Naotora died!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.33,0:00:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the Hyakko Party's finally finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.73,0:00:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to walk down the street at night without fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they took an entire train down with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.28,0:00:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What a way to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.51,0:00:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you I say, curse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done, Mikhail{**-kun}?! Curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how hard I worked to make that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.66,0:00:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All I did was release him from his suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely there were other ways you could have done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:34.93,Default,TLC,0,0,0,,{*}Lord Kershner{*Kershner-sama}, tell him{ how important it was}!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've received a message from {*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.69,0:00:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark of Sirius is not in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.28,0:00:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So coming here was a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.78,0:00:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My research was {\i1}not{\i0} a waste!{idk, i couldn't understand the line as written without thinking about it}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.19,0:00:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We must return to {*}Lord Yevgraf{*Yevgraf-sama}'s side with all due haste.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.78,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I-I'm not giving up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I have enough data now!\NWe'll be able to mass-produce them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Damn you! Damn you I say! I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.38,0:01:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Such an unruly man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,His research was only an imitation,\Ngood only for draining our labor and money. {I'm not one hundred percent on what he means here, but my *guess* is that it's an imitation of the power of the ark.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a more important task for us to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.01,0:01:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Those persistent, irritating insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.99,0:01:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The Jaegers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to exterminate the lot of them right here in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.38,0:03:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this batch of flowers look like it'll be to your satisfaction, Yuliy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.99,0:03:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pretty beat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.64,0:03:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't we be better off just buying a new car?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a better idea. How much cash do you think we can squeeze out of them for repairs?{squeeze out of}{ok, after we talked about this in IRC I'm still not sure how to change the line, but hopefully this works}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep me out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.37,0:03:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, you've got some grease on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.72,0:03:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why I hate dealing with oily stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.95,0:03:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go take a bath when we're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get Yuliy to help too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:33.98,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.98,0:03:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems like he'd be good at complicated stuff like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.19,0:03:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not bother him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.41,0:03:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't really look similar, did they.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.07,0:03:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy and his brother didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.45,0:03:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it wouldn't be good if he looked like a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.70,0:03:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So he had become a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.59,0:03:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me that as long as I was a Jaeger, we'd be enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He also spoke of the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was still young when Dogville was attacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.38,0:04:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and my people never really told me anything about the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,However, my brother surely knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be why the vampires are keeping him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what is the Ark?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is my brother planning on doing with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.93,0:04:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to leave the Jaegers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do, you'll no longer need to fight your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.49,0:04:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge is my reason to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing but this job!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.27,0:04:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you the one who taught me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.72,0:04:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea how I'd be supposed to live if I stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,True, I taught you how to get revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean that's "how you live."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:04:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Mikhail, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's your brother, your only living kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,To live with him is another choice that lies before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.45,0:05:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But {*}my brother's{*Nii-san's} a vampire...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What if there were a way to change that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If, as he claimed, it was possible with the Ark to either kill or let live, then there may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.93,0:05:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If we learn more about the Ark, that may shed light on the question of how you might live.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.15,0:05:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, we must ascertain what the vampires are doing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The vampires used Alma Company to create that humanoid weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.89,0:05:40.80,Default,,2,2,0,,We don't know what any of that has to do with the Ark,\Nbut the question is what they'll do now that it's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,First you leave without seeking permission,\Nand now you tell me that you were on this train?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize for worrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry me you did. Who knows what could have happened if our guests had not been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:06:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone from the railway just came to deliver this to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I had allowed you to train in swordsmanship in order to train your body and spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but I now forbid you from touching a sword again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.98,0:06:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Aspiring to study both the book and the sword is a thing of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You need only focus on your education as the next head of the household.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, there are many things that I cannot learn through education in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.76,0:06:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot accept that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.93,0:06:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to learn more about this world, to experience it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That I am to take your place makes that only more im—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.66,0:06:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.37,0:06:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,For heaven's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to forbid you from leaving the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, just restrain yourself from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What would your mother say if she were still—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.06,0:06:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not restrain myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.69,0:06:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor stop studying the sword!{cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait right there, Ryouko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:07:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The capital's been buzzing with talk of the Hyakko Party all morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt the police will take long to finish rounding up the remnants.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.29,0:07:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame what happened to General Kakizaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.65,0:07:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,After he finished his report, he took full responsibility for the incident
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and took his own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.53,0:07:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm told that it was a respectable end, fitting of a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.99,0:07:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the incident is not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still Alma Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since the incident at their Japanese branch,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:35.87,Default,,2,2,0,,much of their management, including the vice-president—\Nwho was visiting from abroad—is nowhere to be found.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The Army and General Staff HQ are both desperately looking for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been tasked with joining the search for Alma's management.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.81,0:07:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that if they're hiding here in the capital,\Nthey'll even go so far as to enact martial law.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess they really mean business.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.25,0:07:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I was hoping to start on V Shipping as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:07:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,V Shipping?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.53,0:08:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But aren't they innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you tell us that they helped the army on the train?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.87,0:08:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"Vampire..."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.15,0:08:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you get searching for Alma's management.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.33,0:08:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.38,0:08:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you be doing, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like pretending to be someone other than a reporter today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.29,0:08:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A way to live other than revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! New record!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is how we use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.37,0:08:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Japanese sure don't hold back on the hot water!{idk about the negative connotation of "wasteful" since he's enjoying himself}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I came here, I'd only heard about it from my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:08:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.33,0:09:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew you had a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd always thought he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're lucky you ended up meeting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.35,0:09:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{I met him }As a vampire, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.22,0:09:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Vampire or not, isn't that way better than never being able to meet him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is how you got the skill you showed on that train.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.30,0:09:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My father scolded me for being there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.73,0:09:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me to stop practicing swordsmanship and focus on my studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's such a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.09,0:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone loves a woman who can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you start working for V Shipping, Dorothea{**-san}?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you much rather hear about why Yuliy did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.46,0:09:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go with that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I came from a fairly well-off household,\Nthough not as wealthy as yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I never wanted for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.77,0:10:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.01,0:10:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw a monster that can't be allowed to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.25,0:10:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.26,0:10:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who saw a monster like that wouldn't want to put it out of their mind. {In case it doesn't come across right, this and the last line are her confirming that what she's feeling is normal and putting it into words.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They couldn't just ignore it.\NThey'd have to do something about it!{i regret butchering the awesome "that" structure you had going on, but the previous line is making it hard}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.85,0:10:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.73,0:10:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's all you needed to put your life on the line to protect the people from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.73,0:10:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're thinking too highly of me. {If you can think of a better way to say this please}{your wish is my command}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had a fire in my heart that I couldn't keep down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.01,0:10:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just me being a reckless kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.26,0:10:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You've learned, seen, and heard things from all over the world, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.73,0:10:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very jealous of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then would you mind teaching me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.34,0:11:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sword-fighting," was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's something I {\i1}haven't{\i0} learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.42,0:11:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Gladly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.43,0:11:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called "swordsmanship," though.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.53,0:11:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's meet at the bar, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're new.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been a lot of reorganization.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.19,0:11:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's hardly unusual, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I need information about Alma Company's missing managers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.64,0:11:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone and their mother seems to.{this line perhaps has an unacceptable "4chan is mad" risk level, but at least i get to pin the blame on you}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:52.98,Default,,2,2,0,,I already know that they were on the train that the\NHyakko Party attacked, but nothing of what they did next.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They were? That's news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.61,0:12:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't know, I'll go ask someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.43,0:12:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that means that those managers are vampires, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.57,0:12:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Major Iba Hideomi of the Japanese Imperial Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.37,0:12:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Army?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to tell me everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.31,0:12:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! A job well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.81,0:12:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't be able to complain if I charge them big for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Cold out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the Army involved?\NWhat the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.54,0:12:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Connect me to 7036 Yotsuya, the Naoe household—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.65,0:12:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry, but we're not open for...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't been bitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.86,0:13:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.00,0:13:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vampire...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They're...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have had one of your Mockingbirds one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.89,0:14:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Professor sure is late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Put him through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he be out drinking at this hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.92,0:14:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.91,0:14:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.01,0:14:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.77,0:14:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.98,0:14:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay safe as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vampires are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to work!{another line high on the 4chan-mad scale}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we don't have to go looking for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.84,0:14:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get all of the people in the mansion to safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.65,0:14:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and then set traps throughout the house, starting at the entrances.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I need you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming?{anotha one}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anywhere in the house to hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:14:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the storehouse in the annex.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.20,0:15:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But why are you telling {\i1}me{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.20,0:15:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you to convince the Baron to take everyone in the house there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You've actually seen and fought vampires before, so I know you'll be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy{**-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.59,0:15:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what Dorothea told me to say.{What a useful device for humor this sentence structure is. But fuck every anime that uses it}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.92,0:15:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.96,0:15:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to hide too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.42,0:15:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I want you to protect your father and servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone says that you're really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.26,0:15:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.31,0:15:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just setting a little bug trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight's going to be rough.\NYou'd do well to stay inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this, Ryouko?\NWhy are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters are coming to attack this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.97,0:15:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.41,0:15:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We must head straight to the storeroom.{cps}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:15:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What a disaster...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:00.52,Default,TLC2,0,0,0,,How could something like this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, so you know about the monsters—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:05.04,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,My Ryouko's finally lost her mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? A blackout?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.53,0:16:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.73,0:16:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, we must hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.20,0:16:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Using guns would give away our position.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you filthy vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with and take another bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.71,0:16:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to kill me too, Philip?{yuliy wtf}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.51,0:16:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.87,0:16:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One of my race killed your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking that {\i1}now{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.94,0:16:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking back, him being a Sirius had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.17,0:17:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you never had the urge to kill all of the kin of the person who killed your parents?{I could talk at length about this urge and the way society advanced past it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.96,0:17:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.65,0:17:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't you remember what Saki said?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.52,0:17:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.23,0:17:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't the same thing apply to your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the fact that you have to get revenge on the vampires
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.51,0:17:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,really mean that you have to get revenge on your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.31,0:18:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They're falling for the traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.71,0:18:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.05,0:18:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fallon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.79,0:18:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You think they ran away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.01,0:18:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere for them to hide here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.31,0:18:43.24,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,I can smell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit. We're pulling back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Philip!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.78,0:19:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad. They're staging an all out war!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.74,0:19:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find Dorothea and Fallon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.89,0:19:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.94,0:19:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose mansion is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.39,0:19:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's {*}Baron Naoe{*Naoe-sama}'s estate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like the stage has been set quite nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.61,0:19:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.14,0:19:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what is going on here, Ryouko?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The members of V Shipping are fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.58,0:19:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.71,0:19:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll buy time if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:20:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take that chance to lead everyone out of here to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.53,0:20:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.87,0:20:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll do no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.34,0:20:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As the next head of this household, I have a responsibility to protect—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of father wants to be protected by his daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I will go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.13,0:20:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouko...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.45,0:20:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything happened to you, how could I ever face your mother in heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.99,0:20:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.86,0:20:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even sent any money home this month!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.70,0:20:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you die, they'll get the insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up. {Not funny.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, the fire's spreading!{just 'cause shit was used earlier}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kershner!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.77,0:20:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we've got a big one, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yuliy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the last living Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.76,0:21:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do you the honor of killing you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.61,0:21:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't go ignoring me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Brother{*Nii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.39,0:21:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Philip!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.03,0:21:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to fight {\i1}me{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.19,0:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have just abandoned that useless human.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.39,0:21:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.83,0:21:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.11,0:21:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With you by my side!{a little gift for the fujos}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.72,0:23:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We have obtained a certain ancient text.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.73,0:23:35.31,Default-alt,,2,2,0,,{\i1}That could affect the very existence of the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.64,0:23:36.94,Default,,2,2,0,,{\i1}It was because you were there for me that I've lived this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.31,0:23:38.14,Default-alt,,2,2,0,,{\i1}You would have me believe such a thing really exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, it's been a long time indeed, Kershner! {Two lines maybe?}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:00.06,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.14,0:23:30.18,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
